TIShipArmorTemplate.displayName.ScrappedAluminiumFoamPlating=Scrapped Aluminium Foam Plating
TIShipArmorTemplate.description.ScrappedAluminiumFoamPlating=Scavenged aluminium foam plating salvaged from scrapyards. Offers minimal protection but is better than nothing.
TIShipArmorTemplate.displayName.NeutroniumPlating=Neutronium Plating
TIShipArmorTemplate.description.NeutroniumPlating=Extremely dense neutronium plating that provides exceptional protection against various forms of attack.
TIShipArmorTemplate.displayName.XentroniumPlating=Xentronium Plating
TIShipArmorTemplate.description.XentroniumPlating=A balanced armor option offering moderate protection and weight. Suitable for a variety of applications.
TIShipArmorTemplate.displayName.CeramicCompositeArmor=Ceramic Composite Armor
TIShipArmorTemplate.displayName.MetamaterialArmor=Metamaterial Armor
TIShipArmorTemplate.description.CeramicCompositeArmor=Layered ceramic matrix composite plating that disperses impact energy and resists both kinetic penetrators and thermal radiation damage.
TIShipArmorTemplate.description.MetamaterialArmor=Engineered metamaterial lattice armor that exploits negative-index structures to redirect incoming energy, providing exceptional protection at reduced mass.
